        "availability": "gm_only",
        "origin": "canon",
        "lore": "Canon eighth-generation TSF from Exogularity, the first of its kind. The Union of Mankind began the project in 2044 and fielded it in 2047 to escort an expeditionary fleet hunting for the Siliconians' homeworld. It is so advanced, and so optimised for space, that the TSF label was said to be obsolete. It has surface-to-space capability, gravity manipulation reverse-engineered from BETA biotech, a short-range warp jump, a 0-3 G operating envelope, self-sustaining life support, extreme-range particle cannons and anti-laser Kouzuki-Rutherford Fields. In this campaign, GM only (catalogue generation 5 is the highest tier).",
        "attribution": "wiki",
        "publishStatus": "published"
      },
