        "generationId": "3",
        "classificationId": "assault",
        "productionStatus": "production",
        "availability": "gm_only",
        "origin": "canon",
        "lore": "Canon TSF from Exogularity, grown from reverse-engineered BETA biotechnology by an unidentified terrorist faction sworn to destroy the Union of Mankind. Fielded in the 2040s after a large disruptive event, it performs at parity with third-generation TSFs. It is organic, with a pygidial gland for propulsion, yet it carries conventional TSF weapons. Its only known biological weapon is a laser enclosed in its mouth. In this campaign, GM only.",
        "attribution": "wiki",
        "publishStatus": "published"
      },
